---
// BottomCTA Component
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#FFFFFF] border-b border-[#E2E8F0]">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="rounded-[2.5rem] bg-gradient-to-br from-[#EEF2FF] via-[#F8FAFC] to-[#EEF2FF] border border-[#E0E7FF] p-10 sm:p-14 md:p-20 text-center shadow-xs relative overflow-hidden">
      
      <!-- Soft ambient radial cobalt glow -->
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] bg-[#1B17FF]/10 rounded-full blur-[100px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-sans font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1B17FF] border border-[#E0E7FF] shadow-xs">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#10B981] animate-pulse"></span>
          The 90-Day Comfort Guarantee
        </span>

        <!-- Clean balanced headline -->
        <h2 class="headline-lg text-[#0F172A] max-w-2xl mx-auto [text-wrap:balance]">
          Ready to step back?<br class="hidden md:inline" /> Hand us the keys. We'll handle the rest.
        </h2>

        <p class="body-lg text-[#334155] max-w-xl mx-auto font-normal [text-wrap:balance]">
          If you don't feel your operations are noticeably smoother after 90 days, we offboard you smoothly and refund your last month in full. No friction.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/briefing" class="button-primary">
            <span>Schedule a Briefing</span>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/#desks" class="button-secondary">
            <span>Explore The 6 Desks</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-y-2 gap-x-6 text-xs text-[#64748B] font-sans">
          <span>• 1 Dedicated Ops Lead</span>
          <span>• Weekly Monday Briefings</span>
          <span>• 90-Day Comfort Guarantee</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
